[{"client_msg_id":"cf807feb-8a82-4eaf-b747-de7260a37a70","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"たぶん、vimへの親和性(そのまま入れていい)のためにあえてvimの設定が使えるのでしょうけど、調整はすごいしにくくなりますよね","ts":"1620021232.370900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oYZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeb6ef59-4b8b-47bf-b9e1-c6d832d538c4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"しかしなんというか、微妙な仕様ですね…\n本当は iskeyword オプションから `:` が入っているかどうか正常に判断できるようにすべきではあるんですが。\nvim-language-server のサーバ側の処理を改善するか、そもそも initializationOptions で iskeyword を渡すときに char の list を渡すようにするのが良いのかなと思います。\nとりあえず Vim の iskeyword オプションの指定方法は分かりづらい","ts":"1620021191.370300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KKCQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efb5892e-4c9b-4d20-bf93-97eb15017758","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003c@U03C71D7H\u003e さん、vim-language-serverの挙動を調整するPRしたので、よければ試していただけますか?\n\u003c@U03C6TEAZ\u003e さん、これ設定値は考慮の余地のあるPRですので、よければmattnさん側で「こうしたほうが」というのがあればご指摘いただきたく","ts":"1620021118.369100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pPaC="}]},{"client_msg_id":"588a3f7e-e431-4441-a82c-5b7de86f5258","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね","ts":"1620021062.367200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+y4Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bdbf391-5f23-4d9e-854f-4c0d6512e62e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"（普段 vim-lsp を使う人にやってもらいたい気がします。私は普段 coc.nvim なので勝手がわからない）","ts":"1620021025.366400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wZfYh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0da048d-3740-4329-ad1b-7aa88189f126","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"試してもらって、挙動が期待したものか見てほしいかな...","ts":"1620020996.365900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8lQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3aa02db-e0c6-43e5-8a04-06a4627c423f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"はい、それに対処する感じですね \u0026gt; 明示的にはいってないとき","ts":"1620020942.364700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njPMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10853231-b4f2-4080-b6b6-71817cd1e9d9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もしかして `iskeyword` オプションの文字列の中に `:` という文字が明示的に入ってないと、サーバ側が認識してくれないのかも？","ts":"1620020876.363400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MBf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"947f74d1-d657-455f-8fe7-91139d871f75","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それないと補完が来なかたのでvim-language-server側で必要なんかなと","ts":"1620020864.363000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dkD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b20f33ae-1c87-4640-85f6-9242c958cb24","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-lsp-settings/pull/420/files#diff-22f0258bd46def4925f1cba41871d1f61d5492b6908d7effb6672998f2d7f273R11\u003e\nここの `',:'` って必要でしたか？これだと iskeyword の値に関わらず「クライアント側は `:` は単語を構成する文字として扱っている」とみなされる気がします。","ts":"1620020830.362000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620021732.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6f2P7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"726f8027-ce85-4767-afd7-eb959140688b","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"不足や不要なことやってる部分があればレビューで指摘受けて直す","ts":"1620020804.361800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ID8+4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42c3ea19-9bcd-4486-9174-289cf6556b82","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"これで \"s:\" でも補完される挙動が普通になるかなと","ts":"1620020446.360800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zk6T"}]},{