message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"自動でトリガーされたかどうかで結果が変わる可能性がある…？","ts":"1620013265.338900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pyhn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3a78889-05ee-47e5-b716-2eff62aee08a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"asyncompleteからの発動がなかったので、なんかやっちゃってるかも","ts":"1620013263.338700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iTw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc9ded8-c654-4c70-b318-9dfc680bf135","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://i.gyazo.com/8d25dcc1e47bec79851ed0d418141819.gif\u003e\nあー、自分はctrl-x ctrl-o でomniを起動しちゃうから挙動が違うのかな...","ts":"1620013231.337700","attachments":[{"fallback":"852x408px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/8d25dcc1e47bec79851ed0d418141819.gif","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/8d25dcc1e47bec79851ed0d418141819.gif","original_url":"https://i.gyazo.com/8d25dcc1e47bec79851ed0d418141819.gif"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ukv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c59ef468-2d27-45bd-9d82-225d3e55534f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"deoplete は Vim で使うのが割とキビしい(依存がめちゃ多い)ので一旦やめたのだけど、がんばって戻ろうかな…","ts":"1620013225.337500","thread_ts":"1620013225.337500","last_read":"1620026219.374900","subscribed":true,"reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UHK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9499aa40-a675-4006-b517-f679f6faf8c2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"前後のこといい感じにしてくれなくて憤慨していたところでした","ts":"1620013198.336100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rsOw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc301d4a-73dc-40fe-a0c2-b98a9b66edfe","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"とりあえず\u003chttps://github.com/iamcco/vim-language-server/blob/master/src/index.ts#L88|コード\u003e曰く\n```triggerCharacters: [\".\", \":\", \"#\", \"[\", \"\u0026amp;\", \"$\", \"\u0026lt;\", '\"', \"'\"]```\nのようですね。なので `:` を入力すると補完がトリガーされるようになっていると。","ts":"1620013185.335700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620013313.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g6Rqq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d4e6f12-937c-48c6-926c-f6bc455b5bd0","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"lsp の問題は別にしても、補間の startcol を決める処理にも難しい問題があった気がしますがうろ覚えです","ts":"1620013180.335500","edited":{"user":"U9GUS1S0G","ts":"1620013525.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nna"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7138d4d-876b-41a9-abc7-69294260535e","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"deopleteは前後をいい感じにしてくれるけどasyncompleteは前後のこと気にしないイメージがある","ts":"1620013172.335300","thread_ts":"1620013172.335300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hEw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e18f5323-f805-448f-b619-10120a294bd2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自動でいい感じになってほしいけど、さすがに vim-lsp-settings に補完プラグインの設定もしてくれとは言えんな…","ts":"1620013156.334600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Ap"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70c589a5-cc7f-4259-8531-a2cfbb23b29c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そうか補完プラグイン由来の可能性もあるのか。確か asyncomplete を使っていた気がします…","ts":"1620013134.333500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E64"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffbc88eb-f317-4d91-9d35-d89fa2d3418a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"`isk` は kg8m さんと同じで vim-lsp/deoplete.nvim な環境で問題なく補完されますね","ts":"1620013117.333000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FMeej"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03f6cad3-f145-4f10-bea4-1b8f82627c9a","type":"message","user":"U9GUS1S0G","text":"対処療法的ではありますが、asyncomplete.vim をお使いでしたら `b:asyncomplete_refresh_pattern` で対処できるかもしれません","ts":"1620012938.331100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+FQh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27e2df15-7804-4732-8f3d-c578fd6e5313","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"謎だ……","ts":"1620012929.330900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fwN4x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ee9901b-4f84-4150-9425-bf51d6d34560","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あら。じゃあ `iskeyword` はやっぱり関係ないかも？","ts":"1620012887.329700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620012901.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cKp=y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"939c6e00-2afc-4ff5-b468-c8797cf31ee4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、一度関数定義して、保存してvim再起動したら補完された(isk変更なし)\n自分は `iskeyword=@,48-57,_,128-167,224-235,#`\nなので、問題はないんじゃないか感はあるが...","ts":"1620012862.329100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KTBg2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6e40808-c93f-4029-988b-bcd57549a0f6","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ただ Vim のオプション次第で挙動が変わるということは他エディタだとどういうふるまいになるんだろう、という疑問はありますね。できればオプションによらずに1つの定まった挙動があってほしいですが。","ts":"1620012845.328700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620012864.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yL7O5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0c40f43-9c35-40b0-ab54-910433b64a00","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"coc.nvim でもそうなんじゃないでしょうか？私がその挙動を確認したのが coc.nvim だったので。\nバグなのかもよく分からない","ts":"1620012797.327400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/9/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f85eb53-70a5-4c5f-beef-ba9dcb9b07be","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"それはあると思いますが、補完だす契機の都合はあるので....\nただそのへんvim-lsp-settingsでフォローを入れてたけど、vim-language-serverの設定されてるかな?","ts":"1620012791.327200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZrTC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ddb544b-d0dc-4367-a00f-dfb49faba059","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"もしかして vim-lsp が iskeyword に依存している?","ts":"1620012745.326200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4pk1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c03e5640-a216-451e-8d10-02f7de5065d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"どこ由来のバグだろう","ts":"1620012720.325800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uKCv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1202029-019d-49db-a616-882aee206a76","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"補完トリガーと `iskeyword` の組み合わせによっては結果が変なことになりうるというのが一度別言語でありまして","ts":"1620012641.325400","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620012912.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9u0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b36c9be0-fb08-4fa2-8f70-939cb54f9a01","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"`set isk+=:` したら問題なく補完された","ts":"1620012404.324200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8SSw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9a7e54a-c56f-4306-ae8c-a7ae0841cf4e","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"自分の `\u0026amp;isk` は `@,48-57,_,192-255,#` でした","ts":"1620012197.323900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hr5Hs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4959ce47-ba7d-43d6-8546-38862999d644","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`iskeyword` とか関係ありましたっけ？","ts":"1620012129.323500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1620012922.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YSV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36c14590-a92f-421e-80eb-9a2308b29926","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"関数をcallからだとなんかそもそも補完にならない...?","ts":"1620012098.323400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nylrg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d03fa2dd-4bba-4349-86c9-6babb483dcfb","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"変数だと大丈夫だった","ts":"1620011852.322900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7lU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f8cd2b7-b944-431d-9567-a1056aab29e9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"関数でやってみるとどうですか?","ts":"1620011772.322700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAd57"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bd41476-344a-4422-857d-531dcbc1ea61","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ん、自分のは古いのか?、更新してやってみる","ts":"1620011752.322500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NAuX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3ce05ca-3bd8-4e5e-8e63-3002646b5cf6","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"同じ = thincaさんと同じ","ts":"1620011745.322300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OBmfq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04acb62f-9e57-4d09-9396-c1194b5d3960","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"同じく無設定(vim-lsp-settingsまかせ)のはず","ts":"1620011739.322000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fmZoS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6722d039-32ab-41b9-a22e-aab017f34e04","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"自分も同じでした。前はそんなことなかった気がするけど最近Vim scriptほとんど書いてない（書いてもVim9ばかりな）ので記憶が定かじゃない……。","ts":"1620011733.321800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"12Au"}]}